  {
   "ref": "brief63010#5",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 33,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(33,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<ac(10)>",
    "<im(1)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 1,
   "max_lines": 2,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(33,1)><sp(2)><ac(10)>早速だが、<im(1)>次の任務だ。",
   "en": "<op(33,1)><sp(2)><ac(10)>Without delay, <im(1)>here is your next mission.",
   "notes": "Admiral Misumaru opening the strategic briefing."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63010#6",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 33,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(33,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(2)>",
    "#c[F07141]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(33,1)><sp(2)>場所は中国大陸。\nその内陸部にある<im(2)>#c[F07141]ギガノス軍秘密工場を\n制圧#cすることが今回の作戦目標である。",
   "en": "<op(33,1)><sp(2)>The location is the Chinese mainland.\nOur objective is to <im(2)>#c[F07141]neutralize the Giganos\nsecret factory#c situated in the interior.",
   "notes": "Misumaru stating mission location and primary goal."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63010#7",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 33,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(33,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(13)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(33,1)><sp(2)><im(13)>#c[BE5050]ギガノス#cはこの秘密工場で、\n#c[BE5050]新型の強力なメタルアーマー#cを\n開発しているとの情報が入っている。",
   "en": "<op(33,1)><sp(2)><im(13)>Intelligence reports that #c[BE5050]Giganos#c is\ndeveloping a #c[BE5050]powerful new Metal Armor#c at\nthis secret facility.",
   "notes": "Misumaru briefing on the enemy's secret Metal Armor project."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63010#8",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 33,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(33,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(10)>",
    "<im(11)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(33,1)><sp(2)>そんな物を作られては、<im(10)>戦況<im(11)>が#c[BE5050]ギガノス#cに\n有利となってしまうだろう。",
   "en": "<op(33,1)><sp(2)>Should such a weapon be completed, <im(10)><im(11)>\nthe tide of battle will turn in favor\nof #c[BE5050]Giganos#c.",
   "notes": "Misumaru stressing the tactical threat."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63010#9",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 33,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(33,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(5)>",
    "#c[F07141]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(33,1)><sp(2)>まして！　この地球での勝手な行動を！\n<im(5)>彼らに許すわけにはいかん！\n#c[F07141]目標を制圧#cし、開発を阻止するのだ。",
   "en": "<op(33,1)><sp(2)>Furthermore, we cannot allow them to run\nwild on Earth!<im(5)> #c[F07141]Neutralize the target#c and\nhalt their development at once!",
   "notes": "Misumaru commanding the operation with righteous indignation."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63010#10",
   "layer": "strategic briefing",
   "phase": null,
   "portrait": 36,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(36,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(12)>",
    "<of(1)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 2,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(36,1)><sp(2)>のんびりしている時間<im(12)>はない。\n<of(1)>迅速に片付けるぞ。",
   "en": "<op(36,1)><sp(2)>We have no time to lose.<im(12)>\n<of(1)>Let us wrap this up swiftly.",
   "notes": "Lucrezia Noin giving crisp military command; female tone preserved."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63078#2",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 1,
   "portrait": 56,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(56,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "<im(1)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(56,1)><sp(2)>グン・ジェムが<im(1)>#c[BE5050]特殊兵器#cらしき物を\n工場付近に運び込んでいる、\nとの情報が入っています。",
   "en": "<op(56,1)><sp(2)>We have reports that Gon Jem <im(1)>has brought\nwhat looks like a #c[BE5050]special weapon#c into the\nvicinity of the factory.",
   "notes": "Linda Plato briefing pilots on Gon Jem's movements."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63078#3",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 1,
   "portrait": 56,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(56,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(56,1)><sp(2)>先行した友軍はその兵器によって\n撤退を余儀なくされており、\n工場付近へ接近できない状態のようです。",
   "en": "<op(56,1)><sp(2)>Allied vanguards were forced to retreat\nby that weapon and are unable to approach\nthe vicinity of the factory.",
   "notes": "Linda explaining why frontline troops fell back."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63078#4",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 1,
   "portrait": 56,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(56,1)>",
    "<sp(2)>",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c",
    "#c[BE5050]",
    "#c",
    "<im(2)>",
    "<im(4)>",
    "#c[F07141]",
    "<tr(1)>",
    "#c"
   ],
   "jp_lines": 3,
   "max_lines": 3,
   "max_line_px": 430,
   "max_line_chars_approx": 43,
   "jp": "<op(56,1)><sp(2)>#c[BE5050]特殊兵器#cは、工場付近の#c[BE5050]電力施設#cから\n<im(2)>動力供給を受けているので、\nまずは<im(4)>#c[F07141]施設を叩<tr(1)>く作戦#cに出ます。",
   "en": "<op(56,1)><sp(2)>That #c[BE5050]special weapon#c draws from #c[BE5050]power plants#c\n<im(2)>near the site, so our first plan is to<im(4)>\n#c[F07141]strike and destroy<tr(1)> the facilities#c.",
   "notes": "Linda outlining the objective to cut off power to the weapon."
  },
  {
   "ref": "brief63078#5",
   "layer": "tactical briefing",
   "phase": 1,
   "portrait": 56,
   "tokens": [
    "<op(56,1)>",
